"/><title>Le Guide IA — L&#x27;IA pratique pour l&#x27;Afrique francophone</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Maîtrisez l&#x27;intelligence artificielle (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Canva IA) avec Le Guide IA. Rejoignez le Challenge IA gratuit de 5 jours et passez au Bootcamp PRO.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/Logo%20avatar.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/Logo%20avatar.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans antialiased bg-background\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"relative min-h-screen text-foreground\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-background\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-60\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 radial-fade\"></div><div class=\"absolute -top-32 left-1/2 h-[480px] w-[680px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/15 blur-[140px]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[360px] w-[360px] rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-[130px]\"></div></div><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-80px)\"><nav class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 md:px-8\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><img src=\"/Logo%20avatar.png\" alt=\"Logo Le Guide IA\" class=\"size-9 rounded-lg object-cover\"/><span class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight\">LE GUIDE <span class=\"text-primary\">IA</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 lg:flex\"><a href=\"#programme\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">Programme</a><a href=\"#audience\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">Pour qui ?</a><a href=\"#outils\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">Outils</a><a href=\"#parcours\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">Bootcamp PRO</a><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">S&#x27;inscrire</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 lg:flex\"><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-primary/80 h-9 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 glow-blue font-semibold\">Rejoindre le Challenge Gratuit</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border text-foreground lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"order-2 lg:order-1\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"relative flex size-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex size-full animate-pulse-ring rounded-full bg-primary\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex size-2 rounded-full bg-primary\"></span></span>CHALLENGE IA GRATUIT · 24–28 JUIN 2026 · AFRIQUE FRANCOPHONE</div><h1 class=\"mt-6 font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\">Sans l&#x27;IA, vous<!-- --> <span class=\"relative text-primary text-glow\">prenez du retard.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\">Apprenez à utiliser l&#x27;intelligence artificielle pour améliorer votre CV, optimiser votre profil LinkedIn, gagner du temps, créer du contenu, automatiser vos tâches et développer de nouvelles opportunités professionnelles.</p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/80 text-pretty\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\">Le Guide IA vous montre comment passer de la curiosité à la pratique, avec des démonstrations concrètes sur ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini et Canva IA.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-primary/80 gap-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 glow-blue h-12 px-7 text-base font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gift size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M20 11v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 7a1 1 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 7a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 1 1 0 0 1 0 5\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"7\" width=\"18\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>Rejoindre le Challenge Gratuit</a><a href=\"#programme\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 gap-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 h-12 border-border bg-transparent px-7 text-base\">Voir le programme des 5 jours<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\" style=\"opacity:0\">Inscription gratuite · Aucune carte bancaire requise · Places limitées</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8 border-t border-border/60 pt-6\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">5 jours</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">100% gratuit</div></div><div><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">4 outils</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">ChatGPT · Claude · Gemini · Canva</div></div><div><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">24–28 juin</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2026 · en ligne</div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative order-1 lg:order-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.92)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 glow-blue\"><img src=\"https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/3eme%20publication%20LinkedIn-NSE5XzIHyhWO6urTB9qHZzI0VR3Psl.png\" alt=\"Alfred Dah, fondateur de Le Guide IA\" class=\"w-full\"/><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-24 animate-scan bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/25 to-transparent\"></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-5 -left-3 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 px-4 py-3 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar size-5 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Challenge gratuit</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">24 – 28 juin 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -top-4 -right-3 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-primary/40 bg-primary/15 px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap size-5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">100% Pratique</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-16 max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary\">Apprenez l&#x27;IA</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Prenez une longueur d&#x27;avance</div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary\">Travaillez mieux</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Gagnez en productivité</div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary\">Gagnez plus</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Créez de nouvelles opportunités</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative border-y border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-glow text-foreground\">1000+</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Participants visés</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-glow text-foreground\">5 jours</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">De formation pratique gratuite</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><div class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-glow text-foreground\">4 outils IA</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">ChatGPT · Claude · Gemini · Canva IA</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-glow text-foreground\">100%</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Pratique, des résultats dès le 1er jour</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Le constat</span><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Aujourd&#x27;hui, l&#x27;IA n&#x27;est plus une option.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><p>Pendant que certains utilisent encore l&#x27;IA comme un simple gadget, d&#x27;autres s&#x27;en servent déjà pour rédiger plus vite, mieux présenter leur profil, préparer leurs candidatures, créer du contenu, automatiser des tâches et développer leur activité.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-primary pl-5 text-foreground\">Le vrai problème n&#x27;est pas l&#x27;intelligence artificielle. Le vrai problème, c&#x27;est de ne pas savoir l&#x27;utiliser correctement.</p><p>Vous avez peut-être déjà essayé ChatGPT ou Gemini. Mais si vos résultats sont moyens, ce n&#x27;est pas forcément parce que l&#x27;outil est limité. C&#x27;est souvent parce que la méthode n&#x27;est pas bonne.</p><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up size-5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg>Le Guide IA est là pour corriger cela.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"relative border-y border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">La promesse</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">En 5 jours, apprenez à utiliser l&#x27;IA de manière simple, pratique et utile.</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\"><p>Pas de théorie inutile. Pas de jargon compliqué. Pas de promesses magiques.</p><p>Chaque jour, vous découvrez un cas d&#x27;usage concret, une démonstration en direct et une méthode que vous pouvez appliquer immédiatement.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-primary/30 bg-card p-8 glow-blue\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">À la fin du challenge, vous saurez utiliser l&#x27;IA pour :</h3><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>améliorer votre CV</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>optimiser votre profil LinkedIn</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>gagner du temps dans vos tâches quotidiennes</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>créer du contenu professionnel</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>structurer vos idées et vos projets</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>automatiser certaines actions simples</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px)\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>identifier de nouvelles opportunités de carrière ou de business</li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"programme\" class=\"relative py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Le Programme</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Le programme du Challenge IA Gratuit</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground text-pretty\">5 jours, 5 cas d&#x27;usage concrets. Une démonstration en direct et une méthode applicable immédiatement, chaque jour.</p></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-6 top-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/5 via-primary/30 to-primary/60 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-6 top-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-t from-primary via-primary to-transparent shadow-[0_0_12px_2px] shadow-primary/50 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:50% 100% 0\"></div><ul class=\"space-y-10\"><li class=\"relative pl-16 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-5 z-10 flex size-12 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/40 bg-background text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px] shadow-primary/30 md:left-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full border border-primary/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-start-1 md:mr-8 md:text-right\"><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -top-8 size-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70\">Jour 1</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Comprendre l&#x27;IA sans jargon</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Découvrez ce que l&#x27;IA peut vraiment faire pour vous, comment poser de meilleures demandes et comment éviter les erreurs courantes.</p></div></li><li class=\"relative pl-16 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-5 z-10 flex size-12 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/40 bg-background text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px] shadow-primary/30 md:left-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full border border-primary/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-start-2 md:ml-8\"><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -top-8 size-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70\">Jour 2</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold\">CV &amp; LinkedIn à l&#x27;ère de l&#x27;IA</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Rendez votre CV plus clair et plus professionnel, lisible par les recruteurs comme par les outils modernes. Optimisez votre profil LinkedIn pour devenir plus visible.</p></div></li><li class=\"relative pl-16 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-5 z-10 flex size-12 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/40 bg-background text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px] shadow-primary/30 md:left-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full border border-primary/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-start-1 md:mr-8 md:text-right\"><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -top-8 size-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70\">Jour 3</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Productivité &amp; automatisation</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Utilisez l&#x27;IA pour gagner du temps, organiser vos idées, rédiger plus vite, préparer vos documents et automatiser certaines tâches répétitives.</p></div></li><li class=\"relative pl-16 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-5 z-10 flex size-12 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/40 bg-background text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px] shadow-primary/30 md:left-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full border border-primary/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-start-2 md:ml-8\"><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -top-8 size-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70\">Jour 4</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Création de contenu &amp; visuels pros</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Utilisez ChatGPT, Claude et Canva IA pour créer des posts, présentations, visuels, scripts vidéo et contenus professionnels.</p></div></li><li class=\"relative pl-16 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 md:pl-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-5 z-10 flex size-12 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/40 bg-background text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px] shadow-primary/30 md:left-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full border border-primary/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-start-1 md:mr-8 md:text-right\"><div class=\"absolute -right-8 -top-8 size-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70\">Jour 5</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Passer à l&#x27;action</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Construisez votre plan IA personnel : comment intégrer l&#x27;IA dans votre carrière, vos études, votre activité ou votre entreprise.</p></div></li></ul><div class=\"relative mt-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.8)\"><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-[0_0_28px] shadow-primary/50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm text-muted-foreground text-pretty\">5 jours pour passer de spectateur à acteur de l&#x27;IA. À la fin, vous repartez avec un plan concret prêt à appliquer.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0\"><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary px-7 text-base font-semibold text-primary-foreground glow-blue transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\">Rejoindre le Challenge Gratuit</a></div></div></section><section id=\"audience\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-14 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Pour qui ?</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Ce challenge est fait pour vous si vous êtes :</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1.5 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Étudiant</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Vous voulez mieux apprendre, mieux rédiger, mieux préparer votre avenir et développer des compétences recherchées.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1.5 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Chercheur d&#x27;emploi</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Vous voulez améliorer votre CV, votre profil LinkedIn et votre visibilité professionnelle.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1.5 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Professionnel</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Vous voulez gagner du temps, devenir plus productif et rester compétitif dans un monde qui change vite.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1.5 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Entrepreneur</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Vous voulez utiliser l&#x27;IA pour créer du contenu, mieux communiquer, mieux vendre et structurer votre activité.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1.5 lg:col-span-1 sm:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 8h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Dirigeant ou manager</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Vous voulez comprendre comment l&#x27;IA peut devenir un levier stratégique pour votre organisation.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"outils\" class=\"relative border-y border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-14 max-w-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Les outils utilisés</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Les outils que nous allons utiliser</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Pas de théorie inutile. Vous apprenez à utiliser concrètement les meilleurs outils du marché, adaptés à votre réalité africaine francophone.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-2 ring-1 bg-black ring-white/15\"><img src=\"/logos/chatgpt.png\" alt=\"Logo ChatGPT\" class=\"size-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">ChatGPT</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Pour rédiger, structurer, résumer, réfléchir, préparer vos documents et améliorer votre productivité.</p></div><div class=\"group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-2 ring-1 bg-white ring-black/10\"><img src=\"/logos/claude.png\" alt=\"Logo Claude\" class=\"size-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Claude</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Pour analyser des documents, améliorer la qualité des textes, structurer des idées complexes et produire des contenus solides.</p></div><div class=\"group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-2 ring-1 bg-white ring-black/10\"><img src=\"/logos/gemini.png\" alt=\"Logo Gemini\" class=\"size-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Gemini</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Pour rechercher, comparer, travailler avec l&#x27;écosystème Google et exploiter les capacités multimodales.</p></div><div class=\"group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-2 ring-1 bg-white ring-black/10\"><img src=\"/logos/canva.png\" alt=\"Logo Canva IA\" class=\"size-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Canva IA</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Pour créer rapidement des visuels, présentations et supports professionnels.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative border-y border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">La méthode</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">La méthode Le Guide IA</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground text-pretty\">Nous n&#x27;allons pas seulement vous montrer des outils. Nous allons vous apprendre une méthode simple.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 18V5\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5\"></path><path d=\"M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77\"></path><path d=\"M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary/20\">1</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Comprendre</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Savoir ce que l&#x27;IA peut faire et ce qu&#x27;elle ne doit pas faire à votre place.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary/20\">2</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Pratiquer</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Voir des démonstrations concrètes et reproduire les exercices.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings2 lucide-settings-2 size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 17H5\"></path><path d=\"M19 7h-9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary/20\">3</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Adapter</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Appliquer l&#x27;IA à votre réalité : études, emploi, business, organisation ou carrière.</p></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary/20\">4</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold\">Progresser</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Passer d&#x27;un usage vague de l&#x27;IA à une utilisation structurée, professionnelle et productive.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"inscription\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-y border-border/60 py-24\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-[400px] w-[700px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/15 blur-[130px]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-start gap-12 px-4 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-accent-foreground\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gift size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M20 11v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 7a1 1 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 7a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 1 1 0 0 1 0 5\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"7\" width=\"18\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>100% Gratuit · 24 – 28 juin 2026</span><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Réservez votre place gratuitement</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Le Challenge IA Gratuit se déroule du 24 au 28 juin 2026. Inscrivez-vous maintenant pour recevoir les informations de participation, rejoindre la communauté et accéder aux exercices.</p><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\">J<!-- -->1</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Les fondations de l&#x27;IA</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Comprendre et démarrer sans jargon</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\">J<!-- -->2</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">CV &amp; LinkedIn boostés par l&#x27;IA</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Optimisez votre profil pro</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\">J<!-- -->3</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Productivité &amp; automatisation</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Gagnez des heures chaque semaine</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\">J<!-- -->4</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Créer du contenu &amp; des visuels</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">ChatGPT, Claude, Canva IA en action</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\">J<!-- -->5</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Passer à l&#x27;action</div><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Votre plan IA personnalisé</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-primary/30 bg-card p-8 shadow-2xl glow-blue\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-20 animate-scan bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/15 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold\">Je rejoins le Challenge IA Gratuit</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Inscription gratuite. Places limitées pour garantir un accompagnement de qualité.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>7 lives pratiques avec démos</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Communauté WhatsApp active</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Exercices &amp; replays inclus</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Aucune carte bancaire requise</li></ul><form noValidate=\"\" class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><label for=\"name\" class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Prénom et nom</label><input id=\"name\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Votre prénom et nom\" class=\"rounded-lg border bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors focus:border-primary border-input\" name=\"name\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><label for=\"email\" class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Email</label><input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"vous@email.com\" class=\"rounded-lg border bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors focus:border-primary border-input\" name=\"email\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><label for=\"whatsapp\" class=\"text-sm font-medium\">WhatsApp</label><div class=\"flex items-center rounded-lg border bg-background transition-colors focus-within:border-primary border-input\"><select id=\"dial\" name=\"dial\" required=\"\" aria-label=\"Indicatif téléphonique\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-l-lg border-0 border-r border-input bg-transparent py-3 pl-3 pr-2 text-sm outline-none\"><option value=\"+1\">🇨🇦 <!-- -->+1</option><option value=\"+7\">🇰🇿 <!-- -->+7</option><option value=\"+20\">🇪🇬 <!-- -->+20</option><option value=\"+27\">🇿🇦 <!-- --