ground [a]:hover:bg-primary/80 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 mt-2 h-12 text-base font-semibold\">Je rejoins le Challenge IA Gratuit</button><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Aucune carte bancaire requise. Vous recevrez les informations pratiques après votre inscription.</p></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-14 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Vos bonus</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Ce que vous recevez en rejoignant le challenge</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-video size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">7 sessions pratiques en direct</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor-play size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.033 9.44a.647.647 0 0 1 0 1.12l-4.065 2.352a.645.645 0 0 1-.968-.56V7.648a.645.645 0 0 1 .967-.56z\"></path><path d=\"M12 17v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h8\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Des démonstrations concrètes</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dumbbell size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.596 12.768a2 2 0 1 0 2.829-2.829l-1.768-1.767a2 2 0 0 0 2.828-2.829l-2.828-2.828a2 2 0 0 0-2.829 2.828l-1.767-1.768a2 2 0 1 0-2.829 2.829z\"></path><path d=\"m2.5 21.5 1.4-1.4\"></path><path d=\"m20.1 3.9 1.4-1.4\"></path><path d=\"M5.343 21.485a2 2 0 1 0 2.829-2.828l1.767 1.768a2 2 0 1 0 2.829-2.829l-6.364-6.364a2 2 0 1 0-2.829 2.829l1.768 1.767a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 2.829z\"></path><path d=\"m9.6 14.4 4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Des exercices simples à appliquer</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">L&#x27;accès à la communauté WhatsApp</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Des conseils pour votre CV et LinkedIn</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Une méthode claire pour mieux utiliser l&#x27;IA</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary ring-1 ring-primary/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Une orientation vers le Bootcamp PRO pour aller plus loin</span></div></div></section><section id=\"parcours\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-14 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Aller plus loin</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Après le challenge : passez au niveau supérieur</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Le challenge gratuit vous donne les bases. Pour ceux qui veulent aller plus loin, Le Guide IA proposera un Bootcamp PRO premium pour transformer vos connaissances en résultats concrets et durables.</p></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-primary/40 bg-primary/5 glow-blue\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-30\"></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex rounded-full bg-accent px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent-foreground\">Bootcamp PRO</span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold\">Transformez vos connaissances en résultats.</h3><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>9 sessions premium</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>2 sessions pratiques hebdomadaires</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Accompagnement plus structuré</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Cas pratiques</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Automatisation</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Stratégie IA appliquée</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Certificat de fin de parcours</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Accès à la communauté PRO</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/80 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">Prix fondateur</div><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-glow text-foreground\">À définir</span></div><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Prix standard : <span class=\"font-medium text-foreground/80 line-through\">259 000 FCFA</span></div><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"mt-6 inline-flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-7 text-base font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\">Je veux être informé<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"mt-3 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Commencez par le challenge gratuit. L&#x27;accès PRO est proposé ensuite.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative border-y border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative order-1 mx-auto w-full max-w-md lg:order-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.94)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 glow-blue bg-black\"><img src=\"/Profile%20linkedin.png\" alt=\"Alfred Dah, consultant en intelligence artificielle et fondateur de Le Guide IA\" class=\"w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-24 animate-scan bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/25 to-transparent\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"order-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">L&#x27;expert</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Avec Alfred Dah</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\"><p>Je suis Alfred Dah, consultant en intelligence artificielle, gouvernance digitale, cybersécurité et transformation numérique.</p><p>Avec Le Guide IA, mon objectif est simple : rendre l&#x27;intelligence artificielle pratique, accessible et utile pour les francophones qui veulent travailler mieux, gagner en productivité et créer plus d&#x27;opportunités.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote size-6 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground\">Ici, on apprend. On pratique. On progresse.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"relative border-t border-border/60 bg-card/20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 md:px-8\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-primary/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/15 via-card to-card p-8 text-center sm:p-14 glow-blue\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-40\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Prêt à prendre une longueur d&#x27;avance ?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">L&#x27;IA ne va pas attendre que vous soyez prêt. Mais vous pouvez décider aujourd&#x27;hui de vous préparer sérieusement. Rejoignez le Challenge IA Gratuit et commencez à utiliser l&#x27;intelligence artificielle comme un véritable levier professionnel.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"#inscription\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-primary/80 gap-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 h-12 px-7 text-base font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gift size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M20 11v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 7a1 1 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 7a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 1 1 0 0 1 0 5\"></path><rec